+| `ramp_floor` / `ramp_n_ticks` | `float\|None` / `int\|None` | per-tick reward shaping (0.5 / 6). |
+| `forced_break_pct` / `forced_break_window_s` / `forced_break_lockout_s` | `float\|None`×3 | forced-break rule (0.20 / 1.0s / 0.4s). |
+| `drain_rate` | `float\|None` | per-second channel pool debit. **HONORED AS-EMITTED per (economy bin, k); NOT re-derived.** |
+| `tick_tracking` | `str\|None` | `tracking` (beam re-resolves live) / `fixed` (tether footprint). Per-tick resolution selector, DISTINCT from `move_policy`. |
+| `move_policy` / `move_policy_walk_pct` | `str\|None` / `float\|None` | `rooted` (suspend behavior branch) / `walk` (scale movement_speed by pct) / `full_move` (untouched — spin class). |
+| `pay_on_commit` | `bool\|None` | `True` (wind-up/snap — pay at initiation, whiff forfeits) / `False` (channel — per-tick drain). |
