+## §5 — Telemetry (addendum §C.5; criterion 16) — the seven producer fields (sim→star-lord boundary)
+
+Seven fields land on `SpatialFightResult` per (kit, commitment_bin, regime), additive-defaulted (brownfield-safe, same status as `output_by_element` / `escape_reached` / `player_death_element`). These ARE the pricing loop's inputs (guard 1 unimplementable without them):
