+
+**star-lord is the downstream DB consumer** — I add the producer fields to `SpatialFightResult` (the schema addition) + co-author the sim→star-lord MIGRATION section; star-lord owns the DB columns / `_INSERT_SQL` widen / schema version bump (I do NOT draft their work — same handoff as the E3 attribution spine `output_by_element`). These fields are INTERNAL-to-seam until star-lord persists them; `validate()` does NOT enforce them (brownfield-safe).
