+    """Hit-test a channel footprint ANCHORED at (origin_x, origin_y) — a ground-tether (E4 §2.3).
+
+    tick_tracking=="fixed": the template does NOT follow the channeler; it stays where it was
+    placed at channel-start, and each tick re-tests whether targets are STILL inside it (targets
+    can walk out — a ground-tether, not a beam). The probe's heading points from the origin toward
+    the pack centroid so a cone tether stays oriented; for circle/line/point the heading is inert
+    or the origin dominates. Reuses _compute_aoe_hits via the anchored probe."""
